  "title": "Spotify Honors the White House Correspondents’ Association and Freedom of Expression",
  "summary": "Ahead of the White House Correspondents’ Association (WHCA) Dinner, Spotify joined leaders from across the media and political landscape to honor America’s journalists and the tradition of the annual gathering. The reception for the rescheduled Correspondents dinner carried extra meaning after April’s dinner was interrupted by an act of violence, and last night’s event became...",
